<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

    <PropertyGroup>
        <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
        <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
        <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
        <GeneratePackageOnBuild>true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
        <Title>MitMediator.AutoApi.HttpMediator</Title>
        <Authors>Dmitry Protko</Authors>
        <Description>Http client for MitMediator.AutoApi</Description>
        <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/dzmprt/MitMediator.AutoApi</PackageProjectUrl>
        <PackageIcon>logo.png</PackageIcon>
        <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/dzmprt/MitMediator.AutoApi</RepositoryUrl>
        <PackageTags>mediator;request;response;queries;commands;mitmediator;minimalapi;autoapi;cqrs;httpmediator;httpclient</PackageTags>
        <PackageReleaseNotes>v10.1.0-rc-1
- Breaking: endpoint attribute types are now sealed
- Excluded route keys from JSON request serialization
- Added support for reading non-seekable file and response streams
- Added string route key encoding and decoding
- Fixed parent route key handling in Location for multipart POST-create requests
- Improved request metadata and route property lookup performance
- Fixed 201 Created Location paths to honor PathBase and omit the header when the resource key is unavailable
- Fixed query binding for decimal values and case-insensitive nested parameters
- Preserved explicitly supplied nullable defaults and regular Key properties in query strings
- Included request fields alongside the file in multipart uploads
- Preserved quotes and whitespace in plain-text responses
- Removed route keys from OpenAPI JSON request schemas while preserving response schemas</PackageReleaseNotes>
        <TrimMode>full</TrimMode>
        <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
        <PackageLicenseFile>LICENSE</PackageLicenseFile>
        <Version>10.1.0-rc-1</Version>
        <LangVersion>14</LangVersion>
    </PropertyGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
        <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Http" />
    </ItemGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
        <InternalsVisibleTo Include="MitMediator.AutoApi.HttpMediator.Tests" />
    </ItemGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
        <None Include="..\..\assets\logo.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
    </ItemGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
        <None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    </ItemGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
        <None Include="..\..\LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    </ItemGroup>
        <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="MitMediator.AutoApi.Abstractions" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>